          "message": {
            "text": "Structured output from intake-agent is trusted by edge-gateway as already validated, so a malformed field flows straight into business logic.",
            "markdown": "Validate the output of intake-agent against a strict schema in edge-gateway, treat it as untrusted input and reject anything that fails."
