          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/agentic-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "Worker agents coordinate through the shared message bus and memory so that each stays under its individual limits while together they exceed the authority intended for any one of them, and no single-agent control observes the combined behaviour.",
            "markdown": "Monitor combined activity across agents, set aggregate budgets for groups of workers and separate the channels that agents can use to coordinate."
          },
